            "line": 185,
            "text": "theorem massHistory_eq_massAverage {S : Set ℝ} (hS : IsOpen S) (f : EvenProfile S)\n    (w : ℝ × ℝ) :\n    PositiveOrderMoments.massHistory f w = w.1 ^ 2 / 2 * massAverage hS f w"
